            <guid>6rcow1pz</guid>
            <pubDate>Thu, 08 Jan 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[A relentless champion of Ultramar with an unyielding will, Captain Demetrian Titus has won countless battles against seemingly impossible odds. While possessed of lauded command abilities, Titus is truly at home in the press of battle where he fights relentlessly and refuses to give in even to grievous wounds. This model is a true centrepiece for any Ultramarines army and thus deserves an immaculate paint job. Those in need of a helping hand, don’t worry, Ollie’s got your back with this easy to follow and comprehensive paint guide!]]></description>
